"rejimiga <developer-mode>` o'ting. So'ngra shablonning yuqori o'ng "
"burchagidagi :guilabel:`</>` belgisini bosing va XML/HTML kodini "
"tahrirlashga o'ting. Standart matn muharririga qaytish uchun :guilabel:`</>` "
"belgisini yana bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/general/companies/email_template.rst:None
