"Agar bir nechta IoT tizimlari topilsa, ochilgan qalqib chiquvchi oynada "
"kerakli tizimni tanlang, so'ngra :guilabel:`Connect` tugmasini bosing. Agar "
"IoT tizimi avtomatik aniqlanmasa, uni ma'lumotlar bazasiga :ref:`juftlash "
"kodi <iot/connect/pairing-code>` yoki :ref:`ulanish tokeni <iot/connect/"
"token>` yordamida ulashga urinib ko'ring."

#: ../../content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:35
msgid ""
