"qayta ishga tushiring yoki :ref:`Windows virtual IoT xizmatini qayta ishga "
"tushiring <iot/windows_iot/restart>`. Muqobil ravishda, IoT tizimini "
"ma'lumotlar bazasiga :ref:`ulanish tokeni <iot/connect/token>` yordamida "
"ulang."

#: ../../content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:49
