msgstr ""
":guilabel:`HTTPS certificate` banneri sertifikatning amal qilish muddatini "
"ko'rsatadi. Ushbu ma'lumotni ko'rish uchun IoT tizimi bosh sahifasining "
"yuqori o'ng qismidagi :icon:`fa-cogs` (:guilabel:`cogs`) tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:0
msgid "IoT box homepage with HTTPS certificate validity date."
msgstr ""
"HTTPS sertifikatining amal qilish sanasi ko'rsatilgan IoT box bosh sahifasi."

